title:    How the implementation is organised
subtitle: Major directories only. Full source on GitHub.
width:    760
---
week-10-group-access/
├── LAB.md              reproduction guide: commands, outputs, cleanup
├── terraform/          the deployed infrastructure (6 resources)
├── scripts/            validation and the propagation measurement
└── docs/               figure plan, references, screenshots

# terraform/  the group, its membership, and the folder IAM binding.
#             Provider pinning lives here too - Cloud Identity needs
#             user_project_override, which is not obvious.
# scripts/    validate.sh asserts against the live org, not state.
#             measure-membership-lag.sh is the timed revocation test.
# docs/       what each figure had to show, declared before capture.
